In fact, in the script, it said Jim drop kicks his lunch bag.

1443
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.600
So I just want to say what that means.

1444
01:00:01.600 --> 01:00:06.480
When there's that simple line in a script that says Jim drop kicks his lunch bag.

1445
01:00:06.720 --> 01:00:11.480
When Phil Shea is going through a script and he sees that sentence, he's going to highlight

1446
01:00:11.480 --> 01:00:11.900
that.

1447
01:00:12.240 --> 01:00:12.360
Right.

1448
01:00:12.780 --> 01:00:17.680
He's going to go to production and he's going to say, how many takes of the scene do you

1449
01:00:17.680 --> 01:00:18.260
