1450
01:00:18.860 --> 01:00:20.740
How many lunch bags do I need to make?

1451
01:00:20.900 --> 01:00:22.620
How many sandwiches do I need to make?

1452
01:00:22.720 --> 01:00:23.140
All of it.

1453
01:00:23.280 --> 01:00:28.160
He'll probably also go to John and say, what are the odds you improvised taking a bite of

1454
01:00:28.160 --> 01:00:29.100
