1461
01:00:46.420 --> 01:00:48.260
Fly in a new lunch bag.

1462
01:00:48.260 --> 01:00:52.620
And they would also probably have John try to kick it into the same corner every time.

1463
01:00:52.620 --> 01:00:53.280
Yes.

1464
01:00:53.520 --> 01:00:57.920
That is how that little bitty sentence affected a bunch of people.

